DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
43570::$$$message_0368_0000_0000$$$::"Matou...!"[nolr]::
43571::$$$message_0368_0000_0001$$$::"...That was a wonderful battle.[lr]::
43572::$$$message_0368_0000_0002$$$::Well fought, Ms. Fujimura and Illya."::
43573::$$$message_0368_0000_0003$$$::"Sakura...!"[rf][nolr][p]::
43574::$$$message_0368_0000_0004$$$::"You actually defeated Saber, Ms. Fujimura. Looks like I shouldn't underestimate you."::
43575::$$$message_0368_0000_0005$$$::"The biggest problem was always how to pry that pest off Senpai, but you've solved it for me."::
43576::$$$message_0368_0000_0006$$$::"Yeeeek! Sakura's all dark! [l][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSTR3_TIG_0030 _name=藤ねえ]She's totally gone over to the dark side!"::
43577::$$$message_0368_0001_0000$$$::"No one told me we'd be fighting the last boss in round two!"::
43578::$$$message_0368_0001_0001$$$::"Rrgh...![lr]::
43579::$$$message_0368_0001_0002$$$::He got us. The Emiya house is Sakura's territory, too!"::
43580::$$$message_0368_0002_0000$$$::"This is why you can't trust Kotomine!"::
43581::$$$message_0368_0002_0001$$$::"W-w-what do we do, Illya!?[lr]::
43582::$$$message_0368_0002_0002$$$::Sakura's closing in on us like a predator!"::
43583::$$$message_0368_0002_0003$$$::"Urgh, the rumor that all of her pent-up downer energy explodes once a year and turns her into a monster was true all along!"::
43584::$$$message_0368_0002_0004$$$::"Poor Shirou, surrounded by a black-hearted kouhai, hungry foreigner, mean-spirited idol, and an evil loli..."::
43585::$$$message_0368_0003_0000$$$::"Is the only upstanding heroine the beautiful older teacher!?"::
43586::$$$message_0368_0003_0001$$$::"Well, it sounds like you're confident enough to talk, Ms. Fujimura."::
43587::$$$message_0368_0003_0002$$$::"I thought you'd surrender right away if I did this. Aren't you afraid of ghosts?"[nolr]::
43588::$$$message_0368_0004_0000$$$::"Or do you actually intend to keep fighting?"::
43589::$$$message_0368_0004_0001$$$::"Nope. I can't handle ghosts at all.[lr]::
43590::$$$message_0368_0004_0002$$$::Especially when you don't know what they are."::
43591::$$$message_0368_0004_0003$$$::"I wouldn't be scared against zombies, [l][hfwww layer=1][say storage=HSTR3_TIG_0140 _name=藤ねえ]but y'know, you use that weird black stuff."::
43592::$$$message_0368_0005_0000$$$::"It's yucky and I can't handle it!"::
43593::$$$message_0368_0005_0001$$$::"I see. I'm yucky, am I?[lr]::
43594::$$$message_0368_0005_0002$$$::Ms. Fujimura, have you ever heard the expression, 'loose lips sink ships'?"::
43595::$$$message_0368_0005_0003$$$::"Eeeek! H-h-help, Illya!"::
43596::$$$message_0368_0005_0004$$$::"Ngh... I'm sorry, Taiga. I can't protect you. Like you, I have a hard time dealing with Sakura, too."::
43597::$$$message_0368_0005_0005$$$::"...No, you could call her my natural enemy."::
43598::$$$message_0368_0006_0000$$$::"Sakura won't take any damage if I touch her, but if she touches me, it'll corrupt me."::
43599::$$$message_0368_0006_0001$$$::"Mrgh."::
43600::$$$message_0368_0006_0002$$$::"Hehe. That's right."::
43601::$$$message_0368_0007_0000$$$::"I applaud your skills for defeating Saber, but I bet you can't keep up such a flashy show."::
43602::$$$message_0368_0007_0001$$$::"Illya can't beat me, so I think the outcome will be obvious if we fight. [hfchance layer=0]Yes, in a single gulp, I'll beat you black and blue."::
43603::$$$message_0368_0007_0002$$$::"Oh no, she's so evil![lr]::
43604::$$$message_0368_0007_0003$$$::From where I'm standing, it's like something bad is possessing her."::
43605::$$$message_0368_0008_0000$$$::"Anything to say, Rider?"::
43606::$$$message_0368_0008_0001$$$::"...She is possessed."::
43607::$$$message_0368_0009_0000$$$::"I told her that this wasn't her style and that she should stop, but Sakura insisted that this was her last chance."::
43608::$$$message_0368_0009_0001$$$::"Sh-shh![lr]::
43609::$$$message_0368_0009_0002$$$::That's supposed to be a secret, Rider!"::
43610::$$$message_0368_0009_0003$$$::"I-I joined this Holy Grail War of my own will! I won't hold back against any Master, no matter who they are!"::
43611::$$$message_0368_0009_0004$$$::"Aiyah, she really is possessed."::
43612::$$$message_0368_0009_0005$$$::"You're after our star, right?[lr]::
43613::$$$message_0368_0009_0006$$$::Would you at least tell us what your wish is before we take you out?"::
43614::$$$message_0368_0009_0007$$$::"That's obvious. My wish is to expunge the image that the main story created of me!"::
43615::$$$message_0368_0009_0008$$$::"This time, I'll use the power of the Grail to remake the story into a super cute and pure Sakura love story!"::
43616::$$$message_0368_0009_0009$$$::"Ahhh!?"[nolr][p]::
43617::$$$message_0368_0009_0010$$$::"Owww... They're supposed to be shadows, but they hurt!"::
43618::$$$message_0368_0009_0011$$$::"Taiga, why...?[lr]::
43619::$$$message_0368_0009_0012$$$::I thought Dark Sakura was hard for you to handle, too."::
43620::$$$message_0368_0009_0013$$$::"Yeah, but not as a matter of life or death. I mean, we're still friends. [l][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSTR3_TIG_0270 _name=藤ねえ]Until we get the Holy Grail, at least."::
43621::$$$message_0368_0009_0014$$$::"Taiga..."::
43622::$$$message_0368_0009_0015$$$::"Sakura, this is having the opposite effect. It's only cementing your villainous reputation."::
43623::$$$message_0368_0009_0016$$$::"I-[hfchance layer=0]I know that![lr]::
43624::$$$message_0368_0009_0017$$$::I can't let my stock drop any further! I'll just swallow up the entire...[wait canskip=0 time=400][hffacechg chara=桜 face=哀 layer=0 left=7 top=27 time=200]house...?"[nolr][p]::
43625::$$$message_0368_0009_0018$$$::"No way! The Cursed Boundary Layer got dispelled!?"::
43626::$$$message_0368_0009_0019$$$::"Another Reality Marble...[lr]::
43627::$$$message_0368_0009_0020$$$::[hffacechg chara=ブルマイリヤ face=真剣 time=200][hfchance layer=1]Don't, Taiga! Your body won't hold out if you keep doing that!"::
43628::$$$message_0368_0009_0021$$$::"Huh? Why?[lr]::
43629::$$$message_0368_0009_0022$$$::Sakura keeps saying that, but it's no big deal, you know."::
43630::$$$message_0368_0010_0000$$$::"The only hard thing about this is keeping up with all your acting."::
43631::$$$message_0368_0010_0001$$$::"..."::
43632::$$$message_0368_0010_0002$$$::"..."::
43633::$$$message_0368_0010_0003$$$::"...[hfsweat layer=0]That's rather absurd.[lr]::
43634::$$$message_0368_0010_0004$$$::Sakura, prepare to do battle. It appears we'll have to settle this fair and square."::
43635::$$$message_0368_0010_0005$$$::"Oh... R-right![lr]::
43636::$$$message_0368_0010_0006$$$::[hffacechg chara=桜 face=怒 layer=0 time=200] Let's do this, Rider!"::
43637::$$$message_0368_0010_0007$$$::"That's the spirit![lr]::
43638::$$$message_0368_0010_0008$$$::Come on, Illya! Let's give 'em a taste of their own medicine!"[nolr][p]::

